{
  "headline": "Cefuroxime is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; our supply traces to a Hikma plant in Portugal with a 2014 OAI and Warning Letter",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E12", "E5", "E11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include cefuroxime as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product label identifies the manufacturing plant as HIKMA FARMACEUTICA (PORTUGAL), S.A. (FEI 3002807173).",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant on 2014-03-28 and classified it OAI with six observations including absence of written procedures and deviations from laboratory control requirements.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to the same plant on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2015, 2016, 2020, and 2023 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 10.5 days on hand at 15 vials per day; Corvale General has 25.6 days on hand at 14.3 vials per day.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from B. Braun Medical Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
